            <note xml:id="foot.f2"><ref target="../bibliographies/bibl_5397.xml" resp="#mjhawkins">Meyen 1837</ref>.</note>
            <note xml:id="foot.f3"><ref target="../nameregs/nameregs_2705.xml" resp="#mjhawkins">Richard Kippist</ref> was the librarian of the <ref target="../nameregs/nameregs_2944.xml" resp="#mjhawkins">Linnean Society</ref> of London.</note>
